  ('sr154','Wildlife crossing adequacy at MP 14.2','Environmental','Open','Medium','2025-08-14','','SHA','UDWR has questioned whether the proposed crossing dimensions at MP 14.2 are adequate for documented wildlife movement through the Point of the Mountain corridor. Corridor width remains an open coordination item.','','Raised during resource agency review. Tied to the open UDWR corridor width commitment.'),
