  ('sr154','Detour signage confusion at Redwood Road','Traffic & Access','Resolved','Medium','2025-05-02','2025-06-11','SHA','Multiple residents reported confusing detour signage at the Redwood Road approach during preliminary work.','Signage plan revised with the contractor and re-installed. Follow-up contacts confirmed the confusion was resolved.','Closed after two weeks with no further complaints.'),
  ('sr154','Spanish-language materials requested for Bangerter Crossing businesses','Neighbor / Community Relations','Resolved','Medium','2025-03-18','2025-06-18','PUT','Businesses and residents at Bangerter Crossing requested project materials in Spanish after the scoping open house.','Spanish-language fact sheet produced and distributed. Spanish interpretation provided at the public hearing. Documented in the Title VI file.','Closed. Translated materials are now standard for this corridor.'),
  ('logan','Business access concern — Crumb Brothers Bakery','Traffic & Access','Open','High','2026-05-12','','PUT','Construction staging is blocking wholesale delivery access to the bakery roughly three days per week. The owner needs a guaranteed morning delivery window; the contractor has not yet committed to one.','','Escalated to Logan City Engineering and the contractor. Owner has been responsive and reasonable but the impact is real and ongoing.'),
